 style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">한자명, 주소, e-mail, 연락처)이 정확하지 않은 경우 사회봉사활동 </font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -94.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;확인서 제출</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">이</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 불가능하니 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞ </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">사회봉사활동 인정 기관 및 그 외 문의사항은 해당 종합학사행정실로</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 하시기 </font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">4. 제출장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">5. 사회봉사 학점 인정 이수시간 : 30시간 이상 이수 시 1학점 인정</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">6. 사회봉사활동의 범위와 대상</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관 등에서 실시한 봉사활동</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -34pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 국</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관에 등록된 사회복지기관 및 시설에서 실시한 봉사활동</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 농어촌 봉사, 환경정화, 자연보호, 의료봉사 활동</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 기타 학부장이 인정하는 봉사활동</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">7. 기타사항</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 11pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">사회</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">봉사활동 확인서가 필요한 학생은 우리학교 홈페이지 - 교육․학사 자료실에서 다운로드</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">하여</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 사용 가능</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">8. 문의전화 </font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n            <table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"24\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"106\">\n                        <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">행정실명</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"24\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"328\" colspan=\"2\">\n                        <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">학부(과)명</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP